<!--
  Open the Parametric History (MODELING-FOUNDATIONS-R1).

  Three square steps on a spine: a CHAIN of features, each built on the one
  before it. Squares rather than the Sculpt navigator's round states, because a
  feature is an operation in an order, not a place on a branch to stand on, and
  the two controls must never read as one.

  Drawn white and tinted at use; see EditorControlStyles.icon().
-->
